 Staff\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Inspire Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Swift Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Swift Boots (710 gold) as item 1 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Corrosion Scythe\",\"text\":\"Purchase Corrosion Scythe (2,050 gold) as item 2 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Demon Hunter Sword\",\"text\":\"Purchase Demon Hunter Sword (2,180 gold) as item 3 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Golden Staff\",\"text\":\"Purchase Golden Staff (2,000 gold) as item 4 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Sea Halberd\",\"text\":\"Purchase Sea Halberd (2,050 gold) as item 5 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 6 in the Front-to-Back Anti-Tank build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-front-to-back-anti-tank\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8ee,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Wanwan in Mobile Legends: Burst Insurance\",\"description\":\"Defensive setup for burst-heavy drafts where living long enough to expose all weaknesses is worth more than a greedy sixth damage slot.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Aegis Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Corrosion Scythe\",\"text\":\"Purchase Corrosion Scythe (2,050 gold) as item 2 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Demon Hunter Sword\",\"text\":\"Purchase Demon Hunter Sword (2,180 gold) as item 3 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Golden Staff\",\"text\":\"Purchase Golden Staff (2,000 gold) as item 4 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Rose Gold Meteor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Rose Gold Meteor (1,820 gold) as item 5 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Burst Insurance build for Wanwan.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan#build-burst-insurance\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/wanwan\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":89,\"name\":\"Wanwan\",\"slug\":\"wanwan\",\"title\":\"Agile Tiger\",\"role\":[\"Marksman\"],\"specialty\":[\"Finisher\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Gold\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":3,\"releaseYear\":2019,\"stats\":{\"durability\":20,\"offense\":60,\"controlEffect\":30,\"difficulty\":80},\"winRate\":48.23,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.12,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Wanwan is exceptional in dashing and powerful against heroes with short ranges or heavy weight, such as Fredrinn and Luo Yi.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"luo-yi\",\"heroName\":\"Luo Yi\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Wanwan is exceptional in dashing and powerful against heroes with short ranges or heavy weight, such as Fredrinn and Luo Yi.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"However, due to her lack of durability and short attack range, Mages with longer ranges like Gord can poke her easily. She also lacks survival abilities when taking Burst damage and can be weak against Burst Assassins like Lancelot.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"However, due to her lack of durability and short attack range, Mages with longer ranges like Gord can poke her easily. She also lacks survival abilities when taking Burst damage and can be weak against Burst Assassins like Lancelot.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/9b163e2146ae6b0e84941032c3f10a41.png\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_44bfa1dc44deb8d7620605faaa9ffae7.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"70\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_f9b01617505b9562d3bbc75e9d392c91.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Belerick, Diggie and Estes\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"52\",\"heroName\":\"Pharsa\",\"heroSlug\":\"pharsa\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_212e59ee7c8490397278ba68c8063a19.png\",\"tip\":\"Pharsa, Gord and Saber\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"78\",\"heroName\":\"Khufra\",\"heroSlug\":\"khufra\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_398cd0a73db63a4b098ab28de5953a0d.png\",\"tip\":\"Khufra\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Tiger Pace\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Enemy heroes hit by Wanwan's attacks will have their weaknesses and positions exposed for 5s. When hitting an enemy's weakness, Wanwan deals 67 (+3*Hero Level) extra True Damage and increases their damage taken from her subsequent attacks by 10% for 5s.\\nWanwan can dash a short distance after each arrow fired from her Basic Attack. The dash speed scales with her Attack Speed.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Enemy heroes hit by Wanwan's attacks will have their weaknesses and positions exposed for 5s. When hitting an enemy's weakness, Wanwan deals 67 (+3*Hero Level) extra True Damage and increases their damage taken from her subsequent attacks by 10% for 5s.\\nWanwan can dash a short distance after each arrow fired from her Basic Attack. The dash speed scales with her Attack Speed.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_78599b839d691545f6b6be60226bbed4.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Swallow’s Path\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Wanwan throws a Fire Swallow in the target direction, triggering Tiger Pace while dealing 120 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path. The Fire Swallow then turns into 3 rotating Swallow Daggers. After a short delay, these Swallow Daggers will fly back to Wanwan one after another, dealing 120 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies on their way back and slowing them by 30% for 1.5s. Enemies hit twice by the Swallow Daggers will be immobilized for 0.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wanwan throws a Fire Swallow in the target direction, triggering \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tiger Pace\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" while dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in its path. The Fire Swallow then turns into 3 rotating Swallow Daggers. After a short delay, these Swallow Daggers will fly back to Wanwan one after another, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies on their way back and slowing them by 30% for 1.5s. Enemies hit twice by the Swallow Daggers will be immobilized for 0.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":\"85\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_283d9308b3df76c466b2f254a388f8dd.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Needles in Flowers\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Wanwan removes all debuffs on herself and triggers Tiger Pace. Meanwhile, she shoots Deadly Needles in all directions, dealing 150 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wanwan removes all debuffs on herself and triggers \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tiger Pace\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Meanwhile, she shoots Deadly Needles in all directions, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"24s\",\"manaCost\":\"125\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_790a739ceca6895fcaafd3df4514e9e1.png\",\"tags\":[\"Remove CC\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Crossbow of Tang\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Wanwan leaps into the air and becomes untargetable, firing arrows at the target enemy hero for 2.5s in rapid succession, dealing 60 (+35% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage per arrow. If the target is killed during this attack, Wanwan will switch to another enemy hero in her attack range, gain 30% Attack Speed, and extend the skill duration by 1s (this effect can trigger up to 3 times). Wanwan can trigger Tiger Pace upon killing an enemy and at the end of the duration.\\nCrossbow of Tang can only be cast on enemy heroes with all their weaknesses hit and Wanwan gains 100% Movement Speed during the duration. This damage is regarded as Basic Attack damage, and the firing rate scales with Wanwan's Attack Speed.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wanwan leaps into the air and becomes untargetable, firing arrows at the target enemy hero for 2.5s in rapid succession, dealing 60\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+35% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" per arrow. If the target is killed during this attack, Wanwan will switch to another enemy hero in her attack range, gain 30% Attack Speed, and extend the skill duration by 1s (this effect can trigger up to 3 times). Wanwan can trigger \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tiger Pace\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" upon killing an enemy and at the end of the duration.\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Crossbow of Tang\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" can only be cast on enemy heroes with all their weaknesses hit and Wanwan gains 100% Movement Speed during the duration. This damage is regarded as Basic Attack damage, and the firing rate scales with Wanwan's Attack Speed.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f9cc5433feeefb499219539f7c1e62f.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"We recommend Marksman Emblems for Wanwan (Greed—Swift—Weakness Finder) to assist her to slow down the targets with her basic attacks and therefore, hit all the Weaknesses more quickly.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We recommend Marksman Emblems for Wanwan (Greed—Swift—Weakness Finder) to assist her to slow down the targets with her basic attacks and therefore, hit all the Weaknesses more quickly.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"She's best with Supporting Tanks with powerful crowd control, like Franco and Belerick. They can help Wanwan hit more Weaknesses and unlock her Ultimate.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"She's best with Supporting Tanks with powerful crowd control, like Franco and Belerick. They can help Wanwan hit more Weaknesses and unlock her Ultimate.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Basic Attacks to dash with her Passive and adjust position for damage, and then land as many hits as possible with her 1st Skill. After hitting all Weaknesses, reap kills with her Ultimate.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_283d9308b3df76c466b2f254a388f8dd.png\"},{\"skillId\":8900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":8930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f9cc5433feeefb499219539f7c1e62f.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Wanwan can poke enemies with her 1st Skill\\r\\nand then use Basic Attacks to dash with her Passive and adjust Swallow Daggers' paths to control enemies. After hitting an enemy's three Weaknesses, she can finish them off with her Ultimate.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":8910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_283d9308b3df76c466b2f254a388f8dd.png\"},{\"skillId\":8900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":8930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f9cc5433feeefb499219539f7c1e62f.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Wanwan build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. DHS plus Corrosion Scythe spike, matchup traps, positioning rules, and when NOT to pick her.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Wanwan is not a marksman who farms and wins by existing. She is a draft bet that says you can flank the enemy carry four times, hit every weakness, and cash the ultimate before a suppression lands. When that bet is wrong, her ult feels like a decoration on a squishy body.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"wanwan\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"gold-default\",\"name\":\"Gold Lane Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Gold\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"swift-boots\",\"name\":\"Swift Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"demon-hunter-sword\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"cost\":2180,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"golden-staff\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"demon-hunter-sword\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\"},{\"slug\":\"golden-staff\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"marksman\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"swift\",\"name\":\"Swift\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/swift.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weakness-finder\",\"name\":\"Weakness Finder\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weakness-finder.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"inspire\",\"name\":\"Inspire\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when wave clear and cheap attack speed matter more than extra range against short engage.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic or mixed burst where physical immunity will not stop the first collapse.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when healing, shielding, or high-extra-HP bruisers keep the marked target alive through Crossbow of Tang.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked setup that rushes Wanwan's attack-speed engine, then adds range and one physical-burst answer for the first decisive ultimate.\",\"totalCost\":10970,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":190,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"Golden Staff\",\"Malefic Gun\",\"Wind of Nature\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":120,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"Golden Staff\",\"Malefic Gun\",\"Wind of Nature\"]},{\"key\":\"lifesteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.lifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Wind of Nature\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=wanwan\u0026items=swift-boots%2Ccorrosi