skins/wanwan/Wanwan-Summer-Splash-20250722061038.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Wanwan/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Azure Commander\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"2020/11 StarLight Reward\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero893-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/wanwan/Hero893-portrait-20220525170127.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Wanwan/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Wanwan is a spirited young warrior from the Cadia Riverlands, trained in the ancient art of Tiger Pace by her grandmother, the legendary Oriole. Small in stature but explosive in combat, she uses crossbows and acrobatic movement to strike her enemies' weak points with pinpoint accuracy. Her cheerful demeanor masks a fierce determination to protect the Cadia Riverlands from all threats. Wanwan carries on the proud tradition of the Tang Sect, the most feared poison-and-projectile clan in the East.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"relationship\":\"Protector of the Eastern lands and trusted ally\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"ling\",\"heroName\":\"Ling\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow warrior from the Eastern highlands\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"baxia\",\"heroName\":\"Baxia\",\"relationship\":\"Eastern Guardian who fights alongside her\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"relationship\":\"Dragon Lord threatening the Cadia Riverlands\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal invader targeting the Eastern lands\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Wanwan\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":45.73,\"pickRate\":0.13,\"banRate\":0.17},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":45.57,\"pickRate\":0.13,\"banRate\":0.17},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":45.21,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.16},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":48.65,\"pickRate\":0.